/**
 * Single source of truth for Baja Glass business facts and JSON-LD generation.
 *
 * PROVENANCE RULE: every factual claim in here must either (a) already appear on
 * the live site, or (b) carry the TODO marker below. Nothing gets invented —
 * no pricing, no job counts, no warranty terms, no years in business.
 *
 * Schema is generated by the helpers at the bottom of this file. Do not
 * hand-write JSON-LD anywhere in the render tree, and never emit more than one
 * LocalBusiness node per page (see `localBusinessSchema`).
 */

